                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Scratches is one of my all time favorite horror games (I wish I could buy a copy, truly), and when this released last year I immediately bought it knowing what happened with Scratches. I finally got around to play it a year later and really enjoyed my playthrough.\r\n\r\nPersonally I don't think this hits the same high that Scratches did for me, but it still retains that great atmosphere, music, visuals that keeps you entranced. The game took me about 6 or so hours to complete. Definitely check this one out, don't be one of those who may years later begging for a key / be able to buy this years later like Scratches.\r\n\r\nAs a bonus, check out the little freebie Senscape made - Serena, it's super short but similarly retains that style that Scratches and Asylum bring. I will be on board with the next game this team makes.",
